WHAT THIS COVERS
----------------
  release/candidates.csv               metagenome candidates with recall and geometry
  release/characterised_enzymes.csv    the reference set and its exclusion decisions
  release/activity_measurements.csv    published measurements, each with its DOI
  release/runs.csv                     every pipeline run and its counts
  release/training_runs.csv            every model evaluation, including the failures
  release/data_sources.csv             sources and retrieval dates
  app/static/structures/               predicted candidate structures
  app/static/reference_structures/     reference structures, superposed onto IsPETase

